{
  "version": 1,
  "comment": "Page id -> how to reach it in the showcase. The web showcase has no routes, so pages are reached by clicking the Flutter semantics tree (role=button, exact accessible name). 'nav' is a sidebar (desktop) or navigation-panel (mobile) label. 'steps' run afterwards: {click: <regex source or exact name>} clicks the first matching button. If the target sidebar item is already selected, capture.mjs first visits 'Overview'.",
